    "MetricSpec": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "One metric a Verifier declares: what it measures and which way is better.\n\n``range`` bounds a ``score`` (by default 0 to 1) or a ``rating`` (required).\nA ``running`` metric is sampled after every step and needs an\n``aggregate`` to become one number per Trial; ``time_to`` also needs a\n``threshold``, and counts the steps until the value first crosses it in the\ngood direction.\n\n``gate: true`` makes the metric one a Trial must pass: a binary gate passes\nat 1, any other gate when it meets its ``target`` (``>= 150``, ``<= 0.5``,\n``== 1``, or ``between 1 5``), which a non-binary gate needs. A ``target``\non a metric that is not a gate is reported, never judged.\n\nExamples:\n    >>> MetricSpec(name=\"price_correct\", kind=\"binary\").range\n    (0.0, 1.0)\n    >>> MetricSpec(name=\"tone\", kind=\"rating\", range=(1, 5)).direction\n    'higher'",
      "properties": {
        "aggregate": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "enum": [
                "final",
                "mean",
                "min",
                "max",
                "auc",
                "time_to"
              ],
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Aggregate"
        },
        "description": {
          "default": "",
          "title": "Description",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "direction": {
          "default": "higher",
          "enum": [
            "higher",
            "lower"
          ],
          "title": "Direction",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "gate": {
          "default": false,
          "title": "Gate",
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "kind": {
          "default": "score",
          "enum": [
            "binary",
            "score",
            "number",
            "rating",
            "running"
          ],
          "title": "Kind",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "name": {
          "maxLength": 64,
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Name",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "range": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "maxItems": 2,
              "minItems": 2,
              "prefixItems": [
                {
                  "type": "number"
                },
                {
                  "type": "number"
                }
              ],
              "type": "array"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Range"
        },
        "target": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Target"
        },
        "threshold": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Threshold"
        },
        "unit": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Unit"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "name"
      ],
      "title": "MetricSpec",
      "type": "object"
    },
